      "People testing a new business or project",
      "Teams comparing several plans",
      "Investors or reviewers stress-testing assumptions"
    ],
    "business_model": "Keep the core schemas, runner, and examples open on GitHub. Sell optional domain packages, high-volume execution, and implementation support later.\n",
